**Managed windows (normal windows):**
- **Lines 267-279**: `configure()` function - Called by transaction system to apply pending geometry
```c
static uint32_t configure(struct sway_view *view, double lx, double ly, int width, int height) {
    struct wlr_xwayland_surface *xsurface = view->wlr_xwayland_surface;
