```

**Restart flow:**
```
awesome.restart() (Lua)
  └─ awesome_restart() (C)
      ├─ awesome_atexit(true) ← true = skip Lua cleanup
      │   └─ Reset signal handlers (SIG_DFL)
      └─ execvp(globalconf.argv[0], globalconf.argv)
          └─ REPLACE process with new instance (same binary, args)
             (Process image replaced; no cleanup code after execvp)
```

All cleanup code is SKIPPED on restart because `execvp()` replaces the entire process image.

